    {
        "content": "<p>just a minor note on #<a href=\"https://github.com/deancureton/sphere-six-complex/pull/38/changes#diff-e0aa042ed7a24a99818099327895653f17ac10ea99c163721a2cbb0556097277R138\">38</a>:  isLocalDiffeomorph_comp is already in mathlib: see <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Geometry/Manifold/LocalDiffeomorph.html#IsLocalDiffeomorphAt.comp\">#IsLocalDiffeomorphAt.comp</a> .</p>",
