    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"389019\">Chris Birkbeck</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Complex.20structure.20on.20S.5E6/near/618987494\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Cool, let me know once its done and I'll prioritise reviewing it</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Given that there's quite a lot of material here, do you think this should be several independent roadmaps, or a single big one towards constructing the complex structure itself?</p>",
