    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"224323\">Junyan Xu</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Complex.20structure.20on.20S.5E6/near/619594913\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Why does the AI like to put unnecessary <code>letI</code> like <a href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/9ac8a456b526527837d7082ff775213ca8bc9809/Challenge.lean#L44\">this</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Because we do it in mathlib by accident and they train on mathlib.</p>",
