    {
        "content": "<p>Apparently the formalization contains Smale.MorseHandle, MorseCancel and Hurewicz, but not proof of 6D <del>topological or</del> smooth Poincare. <del>I guess it shouldn't be hard to upgrade homeomorphism to diffeomorphism with standard S^6?</del> (but that's a minor point)</p>",
        "id": 619596711,
        "sender_full_name": "Junyan Xu",
